"                    Check it, and tell us right away if anything is wrong:\n"
"                    <br/><br/>\n"
"                    <a t-att-href=\"object.get_collection_receipt_url()\" style=\"background-color: #875A7B; padding: 8px 16px; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 5px;\">\n"
