#. module: account_collection
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_collection/wizards/wizard_account_move_line_pay.py:0
msgid ""
"A collection held in custody names its collector and how the customer paid."
msgstr "Un cobro en custodia indica su cobrador y cómo pagó el cliente."

#. module: account_collection
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_collection/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"A collection in custody is recorded in %(currency)s; collect invoices in "
"another currency at the office."
msgstr ""
"Un cobro en custodia se registra en %(currency)s; las facturas en otra "
"moneda se cobran en oficina."

#. module: account_collection
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_collection/models/account_payment.py:0
msgid "A collector holds this collection past its due date"
msgstr "Un cobrador trae este cobro después de su fecha de entrega"

#. module: account_collection
#: model:res.groups,comment:account_collection.privilege_register_collection
msgid ""
"A collector who holds no accounting right records a customer's payment in a "
"collection custody journal: creating and posting that payment and its entry "
"in their own name, reading the customer's open posted invoices and "
"reconciling them with it. Nothing else of accounting is theirs."
msgstr ""
"Un cobrador sin derechos contables registra el pago de un cliente en un "
"diario de cobranza en custodia: crea y publica ese pago y su asiento a su "
"nombre, lee las facturas publicadas pendientes del cliente y las concilia "
"con él. Nada más de contabilidad le corresponde."

#. module: account_collection
#: model:ir.model,name:account_collection.model_account_config
msgid "A company's accounting configuration"
msgstr "Configuración contable de una empresa"

#. module: account_collection
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection.field_account_journal__is_collection_custody
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection.field_account_payment__is_collection_custody
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection.field_wizard_account_move_line_pay__is_collection_custody
msgid ""
"A customer payment recorded here stays in its collector's custody, booked to"
" the inbound payment method's outstanding account, until a remittance hands "
"it in."
msgstr ""
"Un pago de cliente registrado aquí queda bajo custodia de su cobrador, en la"
" cuenta pendiente del método de cobro, hasta que una rendición lo entregue."

#. module: account_collection
#. odoo-python
